# GrowCold design system

> Single source of truth: `specs/GROWCOLD_BRAND_v3.md`. Read it before making any color, typography, or component decision.

## Color tokens

**Two brand tokens — never swap their roles:**

| Token | Value | Usage |
|-------|-------|-------|
| `brand-ui` | `#C8712A` | Button bg, icon fill, active indicator, borders — **never body text** |
| `brand-text` | `#8C4A12` | Any text or label using brand color |
| `brand-ui-hover` | `#AD5E1F` | Hover state |
| `brand-ui-press` | `#9A5418` | Active press state |
| `brand-subtle` | `#F5E8D8` | Pill/tag backgrounds |
| `brand-border` | `#E0B08A` | Tint borders |

**Backgrounds (light mode):**

| Token | Value | Role |
|-------|-------|------|
| `bg-page` | `#FEFCF8` | Warm near-white page canvas |
| `bg-surface` | `#FFFFFF` | Cards, inputs — pure white for max contrast |
| `bg-subtle` | `#F5F0E8` | Sidebar, table headers |
| `bg-inset` | `#EDE6D9` | Pressed/recessed states |

**Text:**

| Token | Value | Contrast |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `text-primary` | `#1C1A16` | 17.37:1 AAA |
| `text-secondary` | `#4A4237` | 9.88:1 AAA |
| `text-tertiary` | `#7A6F61` | 4.91:1 — large/decorative only |
| `text-placeholder` | `#C0B8B0` | Decorative only |

**Semantic colors — never cross these meanings:**

| Token | Value | Meaning |
|-------|-------|---------|
| `inward` | `#0B7B6E` | Stock arriving, positive, confirmed |
| `inward-bg` | `#E6F5F3` | — |
| `inward-border` | `#A8DDD7` | — |
| `outward` | `#A83422` | Stock leaving, errors, destructive |
| `outward-bg` | `#F7EAE7` | — |
| `outward-border` | `#E0B8B0` | — |
| `pending` | `#7B5200` | Waiting, collection due, offline queue |
| `pending-bg` | `#FAF2D9` | — |
| `pending-border` | `#E0CC88` | — |

## Typography

All three fonts cover Telugu, Devanagari, Tamil, Kannada, and Bengali natively. **Never substitute Latin-only serifs (Lora, Playfair Display, Merriweather) — they break Indian script rendering.**

| Role | Font | Usage |
|------|------|-------|
| `font-display` | Noto Serif | Headings, large numbers, display |
| `font-body` | Noto Sans | Body copy, UI labels, form text |
| `font-mono` | Noto Sans Mono | Lot numbers, codes, timestamps, column headers |

**Type scale:**

| Name | Size | Weight | Font |
|------|------|--------|------|
| Display | 48px | 700 | Noto Serif |
| H1 | 38px | 600 | Noto Serif |
| H2 | 30px | 600 | Noto Serif |
| H3 | 24px | 500 | Noto Serif |
| Body | 15px | 400 | Noto Sans |
| Small | 13px | 400 | Noto Sans |
| Label | 11px | 500 | Noto Sans Mono — UPPERCASE, letter-spacing 0.1em |
| Number | 38px | 700 | Noto Serif |

## Touch targets

- **Visual height:** 36px
- **Tap zone:** 48px (`hitSlop={{ top: 6, bottom: 6 }}` on React Native; padding compensation on web)
- **Input font size:** **16px always** — never change this, prevents iOS auto-zoom
- **Gap between adjacent tap targets:** ≥8px

## Buttons

```
btn-primary   → brand-ui bg (#C8712A), white text
btn-secondary → bg-subtle bg, text-primary text
btn-ghost     → transparent, border-default
btn-danger    → outward-bg bg, outward text
```

Sizes: `sm` (28px visual), `default` (36px visual / 48px tap), `lg` (42px visual)

## Badges / Status pills

Always semantic — **never use brand amber for status badges.**

```
badge-inward   → inward-bg / inward text
badge-outward  → outward-bg / outward text
badge-pending  → pending-bg / pending text
badge-brand    → brand-subtle / brand-text
badge-neutral  → bg-subtle / text-tertiary
badge-online   → inward-bg / inward text
badge-offline  → pending-bg / pending text (always show queue count)
```

## Form inputs

- Visual height: 36px, tap zone 48px
- Border: 1.5px `border-default`, becomes 1.5px `brand-ui` on focus + 3px focus ring `rgba(200,113,42,0.12)`
- Font: **16px — never smaller** (iOS auto-zoom prevention)
- Placeholder: `text-placeholder` color, 15px

## Skeleton loading

```css
background: linear-gradient(90deg, bg-subtle 25%, bg-inset 50%, bg-subtle 75%);
background-size: 200% 100%;
animation: shimmer 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
```

**Never use bare spinners.** Always show skeleton for content loading states.

## Offline queue indicator

Always visible in the top bar when entries are queued. Never hide network state.

```
Online  → badge-online: "● Online"
Offline → badge-offline: "⚡ 3 queued" — always show count
Syncing → "↑ Syncing..." with progress if possible
```

## Page background

Page canvas is always `bg-page (#FEFCF8)` — never pure `#FFFFFF` for page background. Pure white is reserved for cards (`bg-surface`).

## Dark mode

Activate with `data-theme="dark"` on root. Key tokens:
- `dm-bg-page: #12100B`, `dm-bg-surface: #1F1C14`
- `dm-brand-ui: #E8943A` (AAA as icon/text)
- **CTA buttons in dark mode:** use `dm-brand-cta-text: #1C1A16` (soil) on amber — **never white** (white on amber fails WCAG at any achievable amber luminance)

## Semantics and keyboard (non-negotiable)

- Form controls: `<label htmlFor>` paired with `id`; `aria-invalid`, `aria-describedby` for errors; never placeholder-only labels
- Interactive controls: visible focus ring
- Icon-only buttons: `aria-label`

## What not to do

- Never use `brand-ui (#C8712A)` for body text — use `brand-text (#8C4A12)`
- Never cross semantic color meanings: teal=inward, rust=outward, amber=pending
- Never use Latin-only serif fonts — breaks Telugu/Hindi/Tamil rendering
- Never use a spinner as primary loading state — use skeleton screens
- Never use pure `#FFFFFF` as page background — use `bg-page (#FEFCF8)`
- Never hardcode user-facing strings — all labels through i18n keys
